__pycache__
*egg-info
.venv/

# OS / editor cruft. .DS_Store was tracked upstream, so it is also untracked
# here (git rm --cached) — a binary Finder file rewrites itself on every folder
# view and would otherwise show up dirty in every diff.
.DS_Store
.obsidian/

# Agent / editor config and notes: local working context, not part of the model
# or the viz. .claude/launch.json is the one genuinely shareable thing in here
# (it tells the preview launcher how to start viz/server.py) — reinstate that one
# line if a collaborator ever needs it.
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# Reference material and our own reading notes. This is a FORK of Oliver
# Richardson's repo, and none of this belongs in his tree: the PDFs are his work
# and other people's papers, not ours to redistribute from a public fork, and the
# markdown is our commentary on them rather than anything the library or the viz
# needs to run. All of it stays on disk.
#
# The PDF alone was 8.1 MB — two thirds of everything tracked; with the three
# eleusis papers it was 10.4 MB of 12.1 MB, i.e. 86%.
#
# dissertation/*.md holds the citations into the PDF (printed p. N = PDF p. N+14)
# and examples-catalog.md, which is the source for viz/gen_catalog_examples.py.
# If any of that ever needs to be shared, it wants to be its own repo, not a
# directory inside someone else's.
oli-dissertation.pdf
dissertation/
eleusis/
